        "original_id": "1cde82c3-7f40-52f0-b028-05927ad1606d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Valeria Golino, Tom Cruise, Dustin Hoffman, Vincenzo Amato, Francesco Casisa, Bonnie Hunt\n- Works: Rain Man, Big Top Pee-wee, Hot Shots!, Respiro, Beethoven, Beethoven's 2nd, Jumanji, Jerry Maguire, The Green Mile, Cheaper by the Dozen, Cheaper by the Dozen 2\n- Characters: Charlie Babbitt, Raymond\n- Concepts: autistic savant, inheritance, estranged family\n\nFacts:\n- Valeria Golino is best known to English-language audiences for her roles in Rain Man, Big Top Pee-wee, and Hot Shots!.\n- Rain Man tells the story of Charlie Babbitt, played by Tom Cruise, who learns that his deceased estranged father left his multimillion-dollar estate to Raymond, played by Dustin Hoffman.\n- Rain Man depicts Raymond as an autistic savant and Charlie Babbitt as previously unaware that Raymond existed.\n- Respiro stars Valeria Golino, Vincenzo Amato, and Francesco Casisa.\n- Bonnie Hunt has appeared in Rain Man, Beethoven, Beethoven's 2nd, Jumanji, Jerry Maguire, The Green Mile, Cheaper by the Dozen, and Cheaper by the Dozen 2.",
